@TamilPay.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5109

### Log in — use your own credentials
POST {{TamilPay.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "<login id>",
  "password": "<password>"
}

### List roles
GET {{TamilPay.Api_HostAddress}}/api/roles
Accept: application/json

### The master client (the only one this app serves)
GET {{TamilPay.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients
Accept: application/json

### List customers — always scoped to the master client; a clientId in the query is ignored
GET {{TamilPay.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json

### Get one customer
GET {{TamilPay.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}
Accept: application/json

### Payment status by reference number
GET {{TamilPay.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pg/status?referenceId=<reference number>
Accept: application/json

###
